# Optional API keys for the RUN #2 malware-sandbox / binary-reputation step.
# Copy this file to ".security-audit.env" at your repo root and fill in the keys you have,
# OR set them as real environment variables (those take precedence over this file).
#
# ⚠️ GITIGNORE the real ".security-audit.env" — it holds secrets. Add this line to .gitignore:
#     .security-audit.env
#
# All three are OPTIONAL. The audit runs without them; only the public-sandbox submission needs them.
# The harness sends each key ONLY to its own vendor API, never anywhere else.

# VirusTotal v3 — free public API key: https://www.virustotal.com/gui/my-apikey
# (Free tier PUBLISHES the uploaded binary permanently. Use -LocalAVOnly for closed-source apps.)
VT_API_KEY=

# Hybrid Analysis (Falcon Sandbox) — https://www.hybrid-analysis.com/my-account/api
HA_API_KEY=

# Joe Sandbox Cloud — https://jbxcloud.joesecurity.org/  (Community quota: 5 analyses/day)
JOE_API_KEY=
